(77, 'Stainless Steel Base Cabinet', NULL, 'stainless-steel-base-cabinet-1', 'Stainless Steel Base Cabinet\n\nSliding Doors With Front And Back Opening.\nMiddle Shelf.\nLeg: 40 mm Round / 1.5 mm Thickness.\nStainless Steel Construction.\nConstruction: Scotch-Brite Finish 18/10 AISI 304.\nMariot Made / UAE.\n', NULL, 'Mariot Made stainless steel base cabinet with sliding doors, front and back opening, and middle shelf, designed for professional kitchens, prep areas, hotels, and restaurants. Made from AISI 304 18/10 stainless steel with Scotch-Brite finish for durability, hygiene, corrosion resistance, and easy cleaning. Features 40 mm round legs, 1.5 mm thickness, front and back access, practical storage, and UAE-built quality for daily commercial kitchen use.\n', NULL, NULL, 0.00, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, 145, 164, NULL, 39, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'active', 'Cabinet', NULL, NULL, '{\"links\":[\"\"],\"featuredIndex\":0}', '[]', NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-23 15:28:42', '2026-06-23 15:28:42', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00),
